OL,3,GNEWSAGang paid for extra baggage
OL,4,Aallowance to smuggle drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug smuggling gang that attempted to
OL,7,Fimport cannabis worth #13.8m into the
OL,8,FUK via Birmingham Airport will face
OL,9,F"life-altering convictions", the
OL,10,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) said.
OL,12,FFive members of the group who saw their
OL,13,Fplot foiled by having to pay excess
OL,14,Fbaggage charges were sentenced at
OL,15,FBirmingham Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,17,FIn total, 11 gang members were arrested
OL,18,Fby Border Force officers at Birmingham
OL,19,FAirport in August 2024 when the Class B
OL,20,Fdrug was discovered packed into 22
OL,21,Fsuitcases.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
